{"scene_id": "s05100", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s05100.fountain", "heading": "INT. SKYLINE ROOFTOP BAR - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "RAYMOND OKAFOR", "names": ["RAYMOND OKAFOR", "OKAFOR"], "gender": "f", "first": 3, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 1, "name": "LENA VOSS", "names": ["LENA VOSS", "LENA"], "gender": "f", "first": 3, "spoke": 5}, {"id": 2, "name": "NELL", "names": ["NELL"], "gender": "f", "first": 3, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 3, "name": "PRIYA", "names": ["PRIYA"], "gender": "f", "first": 12, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 4, "name": "MARCUS WEBB", "names": ["MARCUS WEBB", "WEBB"], "gender": "m", "first": 24, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. SKYLINE ROOFTOP BAR - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "String lights.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Det. RAYMOND OKAFOR, 40s, wearing his shield on his belt under a good jacket, sits at the end of the bar while Dr. LENA VOSS, 30s, still in scrubs under her coat, pretends to read the cocktail list and TOMASZ the bartender polishes the same glass he polished five minutes ago and a waitress, NELL, drifts past with a tray of empty flutes.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said you'd be off at eight.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Trauma doesn't read the schedule Ray. Two GSWs and a fall from a scaffold. I'm here aren't I.", "name": "LENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You are.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Say something nice.", "name": "LENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your chart notes are terrible. I read one once for a case. Sixteen abbreviations in a row.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the nicest thing you've ever said to me.", "name": "LENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Her phone buzzes on the bar.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Lena checks it.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "PRIYA's voice, small and tinny, fills the gap.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dr. Voss, it's Priya in the ED, bed six just coded again, Dr. Anand is asking for you.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tell him I'm ten minutes away. No. Tell him I'm coming now.", "name": "LENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["into phone"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Okafor looks at the skyline.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Go. Go save him.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ray", "name": "LENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll be here. Or I wont. Whichever.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Lena stands.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Her phone.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Dead.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "A door bangs and SGT. MARCUS WEBB, 50s, in a rain-dark windbreaker, crosses the roof straight at Okafor with an evidence bag held up like a fish.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ray. The ring from the Delacroix scene. It matches the inscription. It was never hers, it was yours.", "name": "WEBB", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Lena stops at the elevator.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Tomasz stops polishing.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Music.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Somebody laughs.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Marcus, not now.", "name": "OKAFOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}